      "text": {
        "status": "generated",
        "div":"  Age: 68   Sex: M\\r\\n\\r\\nPATHOLOGIC DIAGNOSIS:\\r\\nLiver, needle biopsy: Fatty metamorphosis.\\r\\n\\r\\nGROSS FINDING:\\r\\nThe specimen is a liver tissue fragment measuring 1.1 x\\r\\n0.1 x 0.1 cm. It is gray and soft.\\r\\n\\r\\nAll for section, one cassette.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nMICROSCOPIC FINDING:\\r\\nSection shows localized macrovesicular fatty change of\\r\\nliver with an increase of vascularity and a few\\r\\ninflammatory cell infiltration. The portal area and\\r\\nparenchyma show mild and non-specific changes.\\r\\nThere is no evidence of apparent malignancy. Both\\r\\nimmunostaining for glypican-3 and AFP are negative.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n  *T56000, 1, M50080\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nPathologists: 周楠華醫師  病解專醫字第97號\n"
